/*
 * EF13_ATTR.C  Effect 13's attack attributes and random sound lists
 *
 * ef13_catt_table has one attack attribute per row, written with ATTR (charscr.h): reaction,
 *   attribute and chip damage class, guard type, knock-back, blow-away type, damage (pow), stun
 *   (piyo), super art gain, hit stop and marks. A frame line's att picks the row (negative: a new
 *   hit). Each row names the moves using it.
 *
 * ef13_se_random_table lists the sound effects a frame picks from at random: a frame whose sound
 * code has bit 11 set names an entry here and plays one of that list's sixteen codes.
 *
 * Effect 13 is the projectile (shell) work the fighters fire (EFF13.c). Its scripts are ef13_char_table
 * in effect_char.c; the row comments number them (script N).
 */

